      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala waawutmo Daudi múk Israeli oo kureeri mibeeri tsár gaa ayká gwaa faariiká. Asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ al'axweesani gana oó', adór múk Israeli ngur tlahhás adór tsatse/uú gawaá doori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu garmoó Seruya, múk Israeli guna iiár faarooro ala gwaa faakiiká. Tam adoorihe, múk Israeli slahh'amuú úr guna sláy ar faaroorí, faarór múk Israeli kari dahaasiika baraá kitaábuú inslaslángw waawutmo Daudiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
